# ANATOMY 360 — MASTER EDUCATIONAL CONTENT COMPLETION MANDATE
## Mission: Complete the educational material across all 16 human sciences domains

**Repository:** `abdulsince2008/human-atlas`

**Primary objective:** Transform the existing ANATOMY 360 application into a comprehensive, properly structured human biology and medical sciences learning library, with complete written lessons, separate reading resources, separate YouTube/video resources, separate lecture presentations, visual resources, practical exercises, assessments and academic references.

This is an implementation mandate, not a planning exercise.

You must inspect the latest repository, identify every educational content gap, and implement the missing educational material in the actual application.

You must continue through the defined work stages until the completion criteria in this document are satisfied or a genuine external blocker is explicitly documented.

Do not stop after producing a plan.
Do not stop after creating empty chapters.
Do not stop after creating resource categories.
Do not stop after creating a new registry.
Do not stop after writing documentation.
Do not stop after making the homepage display more educational statistics.

The actual learning material is the deliverable.

